OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPuffin at Tees Barrage 'an
OL,4,Aextremely rare sight'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo the best of his knowledge, local
OL,7,Fbirdwatcher Martin Blick said it was
OL,8,Fthe first time that a puffin had
OL,9,Fvisited Tees Barrage. He noted that
OL,10,Fwhile the seabird seemed healthy, it
OL,11,Fwas acting as if it "didn't really want
OL,12,Fto be there".
